            "review_title": "Review at Poulet Vietnam Saigon Centre",
            "review_text": "eileent3821\nKuala Lumpur, Malaysia2474 contributions\n0\nEXCELLENT ROAST CHICKEN\nAug 2025 • Friends\nThis place primarily serves roast chicken. However, unlike most of the dry bland roast chicken served in most places this restaurant has the most tender chicken I have ever eaten. On top of being perfectly cooked. The sauce had a nice balanced flavour to it, although I think some may think it a bit salty to taste. Tried the mash potato as a side, very creamy and enjoyable. Worth the try if you love chicken or just want to have french food at reasonable price. Overall, we enjoyed the meal and will be back to try a few of the other items on the menu that looked good!\nRead more\nWritten August 22, 2025",
